"Notification" means the notification issued under this Act;
(o)
"Official Gazette" means the Official Gazette of Assam;
(p)
"prescribed" means prescribed by rules made under this Act;
(q)
Satellite area" means the area or areas consisting of non contiguous cluster of villages predominantly inhabited by
Sonowal Kachari community and having more than 50% Schedule Tribes population as a whole in the cluster and not
necessarily in the individual villages;
(r)
" Village Council" means the Village Councils referred to in section 4 ; and
(s)
"Village Council Area" means the area declared to be the area of a Village Council by the Government by notification in
the Official Gazette.
